D = {
"Adaptive Body|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** No need to eat, breathe, or sleep. A long rest takes 8 hours of light activity. **Environmental Adaptation (2 psi).** You or a touched creature ignores extreme heat or cold for 1 hour. **Adaptive Shield (3 psi).** Reaction when you take acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage: resistance to that type until your next turn ends. **Energy Adaptation (5 psi, conc 1 hr).** Touch grants resistance to one of those types. **Energy Immunity (7 psi, conc 1 hr).** Touch grants immunity instead.",
"Aura Sight|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Wisdom (Insight) checks. **Assess Foe (2 psi).** Bonus action: learn one creature's current hit points, immunities, resistances, and vulnerabilities. **Read Moods (2 psi).** Bonus action: one-word emotion of up to six creatures. **View Aura (3 psi, conc 1 hr).** Learn a target's magical or psionic effects, hit points, and mood. Advantage on Insight and Charisma checks against it. **Perceive the Unseen (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: see all creatures, hidden or invisible, in any light.",
"Beacon|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Bonus action: your body sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for 20 feet more. You choose its color. It lasts 1 hour, and you can end it early as a bonus action.",
"Bestial Form|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Wisdom (Animal Handling) checks. **Bestial Claws (1 to 7 psi).** Melee weapon attack within 5 feet. A hit deals 1d10 slashing per psi spent. **Bestial Transformation.** Bonus action, lasts 1 hour or until you end it. Pick effects and add costs: Amphibious 2 (breathe air and water), Climbing 2 (climb speed equals walk), Flight 5 (fly speed equals walk), Keen Senses 2 (Perception advantage), Perfect Senses 3 (see invisible within 10 feet), Swimming 2 (swim speed equals walk), Tough Hide 2 (+2 AC).",
"Blade Meld|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Bonus action: a one-handed melee weapon you hold fuses to your hand for 1 minute. You cannot drop it and it cannot be forced from your grasp.",
"Blind Spot|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: choose a creature you can see within 120 feet. It makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, you are invisible to it until the end of your next turn.",
"Brute Force|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks. **Brute Strike (1 to 7 psi).** Bonus action: after a melee hit this turn, your next damage roll gains +1d6 per psi, of the attack's type. **Knock Back (1 to 7 psi).** Reaction on a melee hit: Strength save or pushed 10 feet per psi. Hitting an object deals 1d6 bludgeoning per psi. **Mighty Leap (1 to 7 psi).** Jump 20 feet per psi. **Feat of Strength (2 psi).** Bonus action: +5 to Strength checks until your next turn ends.",
"Celerity|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Walking speed +10 feet. **Rapid Step (1 to 7 psi).** Bonus action: speed +10 feet per psi this turn, including climb and swim speeds. **Agile Defense (2 psi).** Bonus action: Dodge. **Blur of Motion (2 psi).** Action: invisible during your movement this turn. **Surge of Speed (2 psi).** Bonus action: no opportunity attacks and a climb speed equal to walk this turn. **Surge of Action (5 psi).** Bonus action: Dash or one weapon attack.",
"Corrosive Metabolism|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Resistance to acid and poison. **Corrosive Touch (1 to 7 psi).** Touch, Dexterity save: 1d10 acid per psi, half on success. **Venom Strike (1 to 7 psi).** Range 30, Constitution save: 1d6 poison per psi and Poisoned until your next turn ends. Half and no condition on success. **Acid Spray (2 psi).** Reaction to piercing or slashing damage: creatures within 5 feet take 2d6 acid. **Black Dragon Breath (5 psi).** 60-foot line, Constitution save, 6d6 acid, +6d6 per extra psi. **Green Dragon Breath (7 psi).** 90-foot cone, 10d6 poison.",
"Crown of Despair|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Charisma (Intimidation) checks. **Crowned in Sorrow (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60, Charisma save: 1d8 psychic per psi and no reactions until its next turn. Half on success. **Call to Inaction (2 psi, conc 10 min).** After 1 minute talking, Wisdom save or it sits Incapacitated. Damage to it or allies ends this. **Visions of Despair (3 psi).** Charisma save: 3d6 psychic, speed 0 until its next turn ends. Half on success. **Dolorous Mind (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Charisma save or Incapacitated, speed 0. Repeat saves.",
"Crown of Disgust|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Enemies not immune to Frightened find 5 feet around you difficult terrain. **Eye of Horror (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60, Charisma save: 1d6 psychic per psi, cannot approach you until its next turn ends. Half on success. **Wall of Repulsion (3, conc 10 min).** Wall 30 by 10 feet. Wisdom save to pass. **Visions of Disgust (5, conc 1 min).** Wisdom save: 5d6 psychic, then 1d6 per nearby creature each turn. **World of Horror (7, conc 1 min).** Six creatures, Charisma save: 8d6 psychic, Frightened, speed 0.",
"Crown of Rage|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Adjacent enemies have disadvantage on melee attacks against others. **Primal Fury (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60, Charisma save or 1d6 psychic per psi and it charges its nearest enemy. **Fighting Words (2, conc 10 min).** After 1 minute talking, Wisdom save or it attacks a named creature for up to 5 rounds. **Mindless Courage (2).** Wisdom save: it can only approach its nearest enemy until your next turn ends. **Punishing Fury (5, conc 1 min).** Wisdom save: creatures within 5 feet may react against its melee attacks.",
"Delusion|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: plant a false sound or image in one creature within 60 feet. Only it perceives it. A sound ranges from whisper to scream and lasts 1 minute. An image fits a 5-foot cube, is sight only, cannot move or reflect, lasts 1 minute, and vanishes if touched.",
"Diminution|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks. **Miniature Form (2 psi, conc 10 min).** Bonus action: Tiny, +5 Stealth, fit through 6-inch gaps. **Toppling Shift (2 psi).** Bonus action: creature within 5 feet makes a Strength save or falls prone. **Sudden Shift (5 psi).** Reaction when hit: the attack misses and you move 5 feet without opportunity attacks. **Microscopic Form (7 psi, conc 10 min).** Bonus action: smaller than Tiny, +10 Stealth, +5 AC, fit through 1-inch gaps, no weapon attacks.",
"Energy Beam|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: one creature within 90 feet makes a Dexterity save or takes 1d8 acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage, your choice. Damage rises to 2d8 at level 5, 3d8 at level 11, and 4d8 at level 17.",
"Giant Growth|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Your reach increases by 5 feet. **Ogre Form (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: 10 temporary hit points. Melee weapon hits deal extra 1d4 bludgeoning, reach +5 feet, and you become Large if smaller. **Giant Form (7 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: 30 temporary hit points. Melee weapon hits deal extra 2d6 bludgeoning, reach +10 feet, and you become Huge if smaller.",
"Intellect Fortress|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Resistance to psychic damage. **Psychic Backlash (2 psi).** Reaction: impose disadvantage on an attack against you from a creature you see. If it still hits, the attacker takes 2d10 psychic. **Psychic Parry (1 to 7 psi).** Reaction on an Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma save: +1 per psi, usable after rolling. **Psychic Redoubt (5 psi, conc 10 min).** Creatures within 30 feet you choose gain psychic resistance and advantage on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma saves.",
"Iron Durability|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** +1 bonus to AC. **Iron Hide (1 to 7 psi).** Reaction when hit: +1 AC per psi until your next turn ends, including against the triggering attack. **Steel Hide (2 psi).** Bonus action: resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing until your next turn ends. **Iron Resistance (7 psi, conc 1 hr).** Action: resistance to your choice of bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing.",
"Light Step|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Bonus action: for the rest of your turn your walking speed rises by 10 feet. The first time you stand up this turn, it costs no movement if your speed is above 0.",
"Mantle of Awe|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Bonus to Charisma checks equal to half your Intelligence modifier (minimum +1). **Charming Presence (1 to 7 psi).** Roll 2d8 per psi for a hit point pool. Non-combat, non-immune creatures within 30 feet, lowest maximum hit points first, are Charmed 10 minutes if the pool covers them. **Center of Attention (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Range 60, Charisma save: all other creatures are invisible to it. Ends on damage. **Invoke Awe (7 psi, conc 10 min).** Five creatures, Intelligence save or Charmed and obedient. Repeat saves.",
"Mantle of Command|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** If you end a turn without moving, reaction: one ally within 30 feet moves half speed on your path. **Coordinated Movement (2 psi).** Five allies within 60 feet each react to move half speed. **Commander's Sight (2 psi, conc 1 rnd).** Allies have advantage against one creature until your next turn. **Command to Strike (3 psi).** One ally reacts with Attack. **Strategic Mind (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Allies within 60 feet may Dash, Disengage, or add d4 to attacks. **Overwhelming Attack (7 psi).** Five allies react with Attack.",
"Mantle of Courage|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** You and allies within 10 feet who see you have advantage on saves against Frightened. **Incite Courage (2 psi).** Bonus action: ends Frightened on six creatures within 60 feet. **Aura of Victory (1 to 7, conc 10 min).** When an enemy you see drops to 0 hit points, you and allies within 30 feet gain temporary hit points equal to double the psi spent. **Pillar of Confidence (6, conc 1 rnd).** You and five creatures within 60 feet gain an extra action for one weapon attack, Dash, or Disengage.",
"Mantle of Fear|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Charisma (Intimidation) checks. **Incite Fear (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Range 60, Wisdom save or Frightened of you. It repeats the save when it ends a turn unable to see you. **Unsettling Aura (3 psi, conc 1 hr).** Bonus action: enemies within 60 feet that see you pay 1 extra foot per foot moved toward you. **Incite Panic (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Eight creatures within 90 feet. Each turn a Wisdom save or Frightened and acts chaotically, moving at random or attacking. Ends after three successes.",
"Mantle of Fury|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** In combat, you and allies starting a turn within 10 feet gain +5 feet speed that turn. **Incite Fury (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Three allies, or you, add d4 to melee weapon damage. **Mindless Charge (2 psi).** Three creatures within 60 feet react to move straight toward their nearest enemy. **Aura of Bloodletting (3 psi, conc 1 min).** You and creatures within 60 feet have advantage on melee attacks. **Overwhelming Fury (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Charisma save or it can only make melee attacks. Repeat saves.",
"Mantle of Joy|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Charisma (Persuasion) checks. **Soothing Presence (1 to 7 psi).** Three creatures within 60 feet gain 3 temporary hit points per psi. **Comforting Aura (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Three allies, or you, add d4 to saves. **Aura of Jubilation (3 psi, conc 1 min).** Creatures within 60 feet that see you have disadvantage on Perception and Investigation. **Beacon of Recovery (5 psi).** You and five allies within 60 feet make saves against effects that allow a save at turn start or end.",
"Mastery of Air|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** No falling damage. Ignore difficult terrain when walking. **Wind Step (1 to 7 psi).** Fly 20 feet per psi during your move, falling if you end airborne. **Wind Stream (1 to 7).** 30 by 5 foot line, Strength save: 1d8 bludgeoning per psi and prone. Half on success. **Cloak of Air (3, conc 10 min).** Attacks against you have disadvantage. **Wind Form (5, conc 10 min).** Fly 60 feet. **Misty Form (6, conc 1 min).** Physical resistance, Dash only. **Animate Air (7, conc 1 hr).** Air elemental obeys you.",
"Mastery of Fire|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Fire resistance and +2 to fire damage rolls. **Combustion (1 to 7 psi, conc 1 min).** Range 120, Constitution save: 1d10 fire per psi, then 1d6 burning each turn. Half and no burning on success. **Rolling Flame (3, conc 1 min).** 20-foot cube nearby, 5 fire damage to creatures there. **Detonation (5).** 20-foot radius within 120 feet, Constitution save: 7d6 fire and prone. **Fire Form (5, conc 1 min).** Creatures ending turns within 5 feet take 3d6 fire. **Animate Fire (7, conc 1 hr).** Fire elemental obeys you.",
"Mastery of Force|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Strength checks. **Push (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60, Strength save: 1d8 force and pushed 5 feet per psi. Half on success. **Move (2 to 7).** Move an unattended object 60 feet, up to 1,000 lbs. and 8d6 falling damage. **Inertial Armor (2).** 8 hours: base AC 14 + Dexterity, force resistance. **Telekinetic Barrier (3, conc 10 min).** 40 by 10 foot wall. **Grasp (3, conc 1 min).** Strength save or grappled. Then Crush 1d6 bludgeoning per psi or Move 5 feet per psi.",
"Mastery of Ice|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Cold resistance. **Ice Spike (1 to 7 psi).** Range 120, Dexterity save: 1d8 cold per psi and half speed. Half damage on success. **Ice Sheet (2 psi).** 20-foot radius within 60 feet, icy for 10 minutes. Difficult terrain. Moving over 10 feet needs a Dexterity save or prone. **Frozen Sanctuary (3 psi).** 20 temporary hit points. **Frozen Rain (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Constitution save: 6d6 cold and speed 0. Half on success. **Ice Barrier (6 psi, conc 10 min).** Wall 60 by 15 by 1 feet.",
"Mastery of Light and Darkness|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Darkness within 30 feet does not hinder your sight. **Darkness (1 to 7 psi).** Magical darkness within 60 feet, 10-foot radius per psi. Foils darkvision, suppresses light from spells of level 2 or lower. **Light (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Touched object sheds 20-foot bright and 20-foot dim light. A creature does so on a failed Dexterity save, cannot hide, and is attacked with advantage. **Shadow Beasts (3 psi, conc 1 min).** Two shadows obey you. **Radiant Beam (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Dexterity save: 6d6 radiant and Blinded.",
"Mastery of Water|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Swim speed equals walk speed. You breathe underwater. **Desiccate (1 to 7 psi).** Constitution save: 1d10 necrotic per psi, half on success. **Watery Grasp (2 psi).** 20-foot square wave, Strength save: 2d6 bludgeoning, prone, pulled 10 feet. **Water Whip (3 psi).** 60 by 5 foot line, Strength save: 3d6 bludgeoning. **Water Breathing (5 psi).** You and ten willing creatures breathe underwater 24 hours. **Water Sphere (6 psi, conc 1 min).** Dexterity save or trapped and slowed. **Animate Water (7 psi, conc 1 hr).** Water elemental obeys you.",
"Mastery of Weather|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Resistance to lightning and thunder. **Cloud Steps (1 to 7 psi, conc 10 min).** Stairs rise 20 feet per psi. **Hungry Lightning (1 to 7).** Dexterity save: 1d8 lightning per psi. **Wall of Clouds (2, conc 10 min).** Blocks vision only. **Whirlwind (2).** 20-foot radius, Strength save or 1d6 bludgeoning and moved. **Lightning Leap (5).** 60-foot line, Dexterity save, 6d6 lightning, then teleport onto it. **Wall of Thunder (6, conc 10 min).** Strength save: 6d6 thunder, pushed 30 feet. **Thunder Clap (7).** Constitution save: 8d6 thunder, Stunned.",
"Mastery of Wood and Earth|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** +1 bonus to AC. **Animate Weapon (1 to 7 psi).** Your one-handed melee weapon attacks a creature within 30 feet, plus 1d10 force per psi. **Warp Weapon (2).** Strength save or a nonmagical weapon cannot attack until your next turn ends. **Warp Armor (3).** Constitution save or nonmagical armor gives AC 10 + Dexterity. **Wall of Wood (3, conc 1 hr).** 60 by 15 by 1 feet. **Armored Form (6, conc 1 min).** Physical resistance. **Animate Earth (7, conc 1 hr).** Earth elemental obeys you.",
"Mind Meld|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Bonus action: telepathy with a willing creature within 120 feet that has Intelligence 2 or higher. It lasts until the end of this turn. No shared language is needed. You also gain perfect recall of one memory of the target's choice.",
"Mind Slam|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: a creature within 60 feet makes a Constitution save or takes 1d6 force damage. If damaged and Large or smaller, it falls prone. Damage rises to 2d6 at level 5, 3d6 at level 11, and 4d6 at level 17.",
"Mind Thrust|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: a creature within 120 feet makes an Intelligence save or takes 1d10 psychic damage. Damage rises to 2d10 at level 5, 3d10 at level 11, and 4d10 at level 17.",
"Mystic Charm|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: one humanoid within 120 feet makes a Charisma save or is Charmed by you until the end of your next turn.",
"Mystic Hand|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: manipulate or move one object within 30 feet, up to 10 lbs., not worn or carried. A loose object moves up to 30 feet. It can open an unlocked door or pour a drink. It drops at the end of your turn.",
"Nomadic Arrow|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Ranged weapon attacks ignore disadvantage. If disadvantage applied, the roll also cannot gain advantage. **Speed Dart (1 to 7 psi).** Bonus action: your next ranged hit this turn deals extra 1d10 psychic per psi. **Seeking Missile (2 psi).** Reaction when you miss with a ranged attack: repeat the roll against the same target. **Faithful Archer (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: an extra attack with the weapon at the start of each of your turns. A thrown weapon returns to you.",
"Nomadic Chameleon|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks. **Chameleon (2 psi).** Action: try to hide even without meeting the requirements. You stay hidden at turn end only if you then meet them. **Step from Sight (3 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: you turn invisible, plus one more visible creature within 60 feet per extra psi. Invisibility ends for a target after it attacks, casts, or affects a creature. **Enduring Invisibility (7 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: invisible until concentration ends.",
"Nomadic Mind|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Gain one skill or tool proficiency, or one language, until focus ends. **Wandering Mind (2 to 6 psi, conc 10 min).** One listed skill proficiency per 2 psi for 1 hour. **Find Creature (2, conc 1 hr).** Learn its area, 1 to 3 miles wide, or its plane. **Item Lore (3, conc 1 hr).** Identify an item. **Psychic Speech (5).** Understand all languages 1 hour. **Wandering Eye (6, conc 1 hr).** Invisible sensor. **Phasing Eye (7, conc 1 hr).** Passes through objects.",
"Nomadic Step|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** After teleporting, speed +10 feet that turn. **Step of a Dozen Paces (1 to 7 psi).** If unmoved: teleport 20 feet per psi, speed 0. **Nomadic Anchor (1).** Teleport anchor for 8 hours. **Defensive Step (2).** Reaction when hit: +4 AC, teleport 10 feet. **There and Back (2).** Teleport 20 feet, move half speed, optionally return. **Transposition (3).** Swap with an ally. **Baleful Transposition (5).** Wisdom save or swap, range 120. **Phantom Caravan (6).** Six willing creatures teleport 1 mile. **Nomad's Gate (7, conc 1 hr).** Paired portals.",
"Precognition|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on initiative rolls. **Precognitive Hunch (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: add a d4 to attacks, saves, and ability checks. **All-Around Sight (3 psi).** Reaction when hit: the attack has disadvantage. **Danger Sense (5 psi, conc 8 hr).** You cannot be surprised, attacks against you gain no advantage, and you get +10 to initiative. **Victory Before Battle (7 psi).** On rolling initiative, you and five creatures within 60 feet get +10 to initiative.",
"Psionic Restoration|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Bonus action: touch and stabilize a creature at 0 hit points. **Mend Wounds (1 to 7 psi).** Touch heals 1d8 per psi. **Restore Health (3 psi).** Touch removes Blinded, Deafened, Paralyzed, Poisoned, or one disease. **Restore Life (5 psi).** Touch a creature dead under 1 minute: it returns with 1 hit point. Not for old age or missing vital parts. **Restore Vigor (7 psi).** Touch removes an ability score reduction, a hit point maximum reduction, or one exhaustion level.",
"Psionic Weapon|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Choose a held weapon or unarmed strike. Its damage is psychic and magical. Before mystic level 6, you add no Strength or Dexterity modifier to its damage. **Ethereal Weapon (1 psi).** Bonus action: your next attack this turn needs no attack roll. Dexterity save, full damage on failure, half and no extra effects on success. **Lethal Strike (1 to 7 psi).** Bonus action: next hit this turn adds 1d10 psychic per psi. **Augmented Weapon (5 psi, conc 10 min).** Touched weapon becomes magic, +3 to attack and damage.",
"Psychic Assault|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** +2 damage on psychic psionic talents. **Psionic Blast (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60: 1d8 psychic per psi, no save. **Ego Whip (3 psi).** Intelligence save: 3d8 psychic, next action only Dodge, Disengage, or Hide. Half on success. **Id Insinuation (5 psi).** Intelligence save: 5d8 psychic, next action only Dodge or Attack. Half on success. **Psychic Blast (6 psi).** 60-foot cone, Intelligence save, 8d8 psychic, +8d8 per extra psi. **Psychic Crush (7 psi).** 20-foot cube within 120 feet, Intelligence save: 8d8 psychic, Stunned.",
"Psychic Disruption|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Charisma (Deception) checks. **Distracting Haze (1 to 7 psi, conc 1 min).** Range 60, Intelligence save: 1d10 psychic per psi and sees only 10 feet. Half damage on success. **Daze (3 psi).** Intelligence save or Incapacitated until your next turn ends or it takes damage. **Mind Storm (5 psi).** 20-foot radius within 60 feet, Wisdom save: 6d8 psychic and disadvantage on saves until your next turn ends. Half damage on success. +6d8 per extra psi.",
"Psychic Hammer|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "Talent. Action: a creature within 120 feet makes a Strength save or takes 1d6 force damage. If damaged and Large or smaller, you move it 10 feet in a straight line, but not off the ground. Damage rises to 2d6 at level 5, 3d6 at level 11, and 4d6 at level 17.",
"Psychic Inquisition|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** You know when a telepathic communicator lies. **Hammer of Inquisition (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60, Intelligence save: 1d10 psychic per psi and disadvantage on its next Wisdom save. Half damage on success. **Forceful Query (2 psi).** Yes or no question within 30 feet. Wisdom save or a truthful answer. **Ransack Mind (5 psi, conc 1 hr).** Three Intelligence saves. Each failure reveals more memories: 12, 24, or 48 hours. **Phantom Idea (6 psi, conc 1 hr).** Three Intelligence saves plant a memory lasting 4, 24, or 48 hours.",
"Psychic Phantoms|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Advantage on Charisma (Deception) checks. **Distracting Figment (1 to 7 psi).** Range 60, Intelligence save: 1d10 psychic per psi, no reactions, and melee attacks against it have advantage until your next turn ends. Half damage on success. **Phantom Foe (3 psi, conc 1 min).** Intelligence save: no reactions and 1d8 psychic each turn. +1d8 per extra psi. **Phantom Betrayal (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Intelligence save or it targets its allies. **Phantom Riches (7 psi, conc 1 min).** Intelligence save or you steer its movement.",
"Telepathic Contact|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Telepathy with up to six creatures at once, or gain Telepathy if you lack it. **Exacting Query (2 psi).** Intelligence save or it truthfully answers one question. **Occluded Mind (2).** Intelligence save or it believes a ten-word statement for 5 minutes. **Broken Will (5).** Intelligence save or you choose its next move and action. **Psychic Grip (6, conc 1 min).** Range 60, Intelligence save or Paralyzed. **Psychic Domination (7, conc 1 min).** Intelligence save or you control its actions. A success blocks reuse on it until a long rest.",
"Third Eye|UATHEMYSTICCLASS": "**Focus.** Darkvision 60 feet, or +10 feet if you already have 60 or more. **Tremorsense (2 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: tremorsense 30 feet. **Unwavering Eye (2 psi).** Bonus action: advantage on Wisdom checks for 1 minute. **Piercing Sight (3 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: see through objects up to 1 foot thick within 30 feet. **Truesight (5 psi, conc 1 min).** Bonus action: truesight 30 feet.",
}
